{"type":"item.completed","item":{"id":"item_3","type":"agent_message","text":"{\n  \"prompt\": \"Minecraft builder reference sheet, landscape 3:2, crisp vanilla Minecraft voxel style, plain light ivory background, sunlit, no characters or animals. Two views SIDE BY SIDE: LEFT straight-on orthographic front elevation of the ENTIRE row; RIGHT three-quarter view of the SAME entire row at the same scale. Fit every plot in both panels, no cropping. 96 blocks wide, 19 deep, one or two storeys, chimney tops about 20 blocks. Skilled human builder quality: substantial massing, recessed framed windows, projecting porches, stairs/slabs for roof verges/eaves/ridges, fences/walls/trapdoors/lanterns for fine detail. Small labels 0–7 identify plots; heading FRONT ELEVATION and THREE-QUARTER. Include a compact exact-block-id materials key if space allows.\\nA gravel mill-village lane with wheel ruts crosses the front, lantern posts every 12 blocks. Each plot has a picket fence and centered gate. WEST TO EAST in BOTH views:\\n0: Dogtrot house, two stripped_dark_oak_log pens under a single brown exposed_cut_copper side-gable roof, open central breezeway behind full-width spruce porch, cobblestone fieldstone chimney at back.\\n1: Narrow ochre acacia_planks clapboard camelback shotgun, white smooth_quartz corner boards, mangrove_trapdoor oxblood shutters, galvanized stone/stone_slab front-gable roof; taller two-storey rear hump with own gable; bricks chimney west.\\n2: Tall white smooth_quartz I-house, one room deep, symmetrical THREE-bay facade, warped_trapdoor dark green shutters. Full-width TWO-storey porch, pale posts, railed upper gallery, quartz cornice, dark deepslate_tile_stairs/deepslate_tile_slab side-gable roof, slim bricks end chimneys on BOTH white gables.\\n3: Square four-room pale_oak_planks grey-white weatherboard cottage, red polished_granite_stairs/polished_granite_slab pyramid roof, ONE brick chimney at apex, full front porch.\\n4: Long TWO-storey mangrove_planks oxb